# Implementation Plan - Fix WorldLoop Tests

Fix the 8 failing tests and investigate/address the 51 skipped tests to achieve a stable test suite.

## Proposed Changes

### AI & Core Unit Tests
- [MODIFY] [tests/unit/ai/test_emotions.py](file:///d:/Projects/rpg-based-simulation/tests/unit/ai/test_emotions.py): Mock `actor.stats.hp_ratio` and `actor.progression.age_ticks` as floats/ints to avoid `TypeError` when compared in [AIBrain](file:///d:/Projects/rpg-based-simulation/src/ai/brain.py#37-199).
- [MODIFY] [tests/unit/ai/test_stuck.py](file:///d:/Projects/rpg-based-simulation/tests/unit/ai/test_stuck.py): Same as above; also fix `FactionRegistry.is_hostile` mocking.
- [MODIFY] [tests/unit/core/test_breakthroughs.py](file:///d:/Projects/rpg-based-simulation/tests/unit/core/test_breakthroughs.py): Ensure `stats.atk` and traits are properly mocked for comparison.
- [MODIFY] [tests/unit/core/test_genetics.py](file:///d:/Projects/rpg-based-simulation/tests/unit/core/test_genetics.py): Fix [FactionRegistry](file:///d:/Projects/rpg-based-simulation/src/core/faction.py#52-233) mocking.

### Quest System
- [MODIFY] [src/core/quests.py](file:///d:/Projects/rpg-based-simulation/src/core/quests.py): Ensure `target_pos` is correctly initialized at the top of [generate_quest](file:///d:/Projects/rpg-based-simulation/src/core/quests.py#227-360) and not shadowed or conditionally skipped in a way that leads to `UnboundLocalError`.

### Test Suite Stability
- Investigate skip reasons for the 51 tests. If they are due to missing environment (Redis/Kafka), ensure they are elegantly skipped with clear messages or mocked where appropriate for unit tests.

